[4] Proof-shaped readout
  Necessary condition for strict counterexample:
    every finite Toeplitz matrix T_d(fhat_S) is PSD.
  Failure gives a rigorous dual certificate:
    choose eigenvector c with c*T_d*c<0; then
    integral (C_S(t)-1)*|sum c_j exp(2*pi*i*j*t)|^2 dt < 0,
    forcing C_S(t)=0 on positive measure and hence M(S)>1/14.
  Finite-bank signal:
    AP/GW are PSD to numerical precision; all positive named hard rows
    tested fail by degree <=160, with most failures already <=101
    and several failures already <=64.
